    },
    {
      "id": "1484242726693376050",
      "fecha_utc": "2026-03-19T17:30:41.940000+00:00",
      "fecha_local": "2026-03-19",
      "editado_utc": null,
      "texto": "Kilzer: **la pilla** aun queda por hacer pero creo que una semana viniedo todos los dias podre ya habrir y hacer una gran inahuguracion",
      "mensaje_sha256": "031be419dcc485548589b915ba46fc5a475a04b57f726fbaed5624e7c94d7b05",
      "tipo_discord": 0,
      "referencia": null,
      "url_discord": "https://discord.com/channels/946724148628041748/1465410265544921190/1484242726693376050",
      "texto_sha256": "fd67591c053a5ec5a87b46c7d474b7499eac63229561c1c473905acfed6612da",
      "adjuntos": []
    },
    {
      "id": "1484243323962261707",
      "fecha_utc": "2026-03-19T17:33:04.340000+00:00",
      "fecha_local": "2026-03-19",
      "editado_utc": null,
      "texto": "Ione: haz un concurso de peleas fuera de aqui y haz a la gente apostar, seguro se une gente... Yo me meteria seguro",
      "mensaje_sha256": "ea72ef30205c8fe9b455b1afbcb47eccec86c087b23ad2445b17cd1bc56343e6",
      "tipo_discord": 0,
      "referencia": null,
      "url_discord": "https://discord.com/channels/946724148628041748/1465410265544921190/1484243323962261707",
      "texto_sha256": "c9b36e25678c9c30be15bd487dfd4ee30efe7faeb813563f0e1a051f5833ea30",
      "adjuntos": []
    },
    {
      "id": "1484244492197302334",
      "fecha_utc": "2026-03-19T17:37:42.869000+00:00",
      "fecha_local": "2026-03-19",
      "editado_utc": null,
      "texto": "Kilzer: es una idea la verdad",
      "mensaje_sha256": "bd1fd6a3049812778b59db1d1427269dde851e0d2b9ceb863be907fe1244ed7e",
      "tipo_discord": 0,
      "referencia": null,
      "url_discord": "https://discord.com/channels/946724148628041748/1465410265544921190/1484244492197302334",
      "texto_sha256": "243bb97d0081709080de0dc5f450f5ab7ffaa79c68107057f6ac955137c49c5e",
      "adjuntos": []
    },
    {
      "id": "1484245025335279738",
      "fecha_utc": "2026-03-19T17:39:49.979000+00:00",
      "fecha_local": "2026-03-19",
      "editado_utc": null,
      "texto": "Ione: **Sonrie** Ves ves y asi yo puedo pelear",
      "mensaje_sha256": "75e23005ba53e91ef1b1be5e9833ba1f7312d47771b94dc6bc656d246912bae8",
      "tipo_discord": 0,
      "referencia": null,
      "url_discord": "https://discord.com/channels/946724148628041748/1465410265544921190/1484245025335279738",
      "texto_sha256": "f72dbec6b96a567400bb280187cd73e3998b371f20d2487814716e147db475d8",
      "adjuntos": []
    },
    {
      "id": "1484247445138313269",
      "fecha_utc": "2026-03-19T17:49:26.905000+00:00",
      "fecha_local": "2026-03-19",
      "editado_utc": null,
      "texto": "Kilzer: No me cabe duda",
      "mensaje_sha256": "139a230143653dd739139aefa93ac111a06be4314b4a8b4bce70fa0b279a4246",
      "tipo_discord": 0,
      "referencia": null,
      "url_discord": "https://discord.com/channels/946724148628041748/1465410265544921190/1484247445138313269",
      "texto_sha256": "1654d006afcc565e363373a0d461d5ab2f102ac48890ab74e95beb93a758e2ee",
      "adjuntos": []
    },
    {
      "id": "1484248397937512651",
      "fecha_utc": "2026-03-19T17:53:14.070000+00:00",
      "fecha_local": "2026-03-19",
      "editado_utc": null,
      "texto": "Ione: bueno por esto te libras de la cena... Pero a la proxima no eh **Clava que te clava**",
      "mensaje_sha256": "da14ae405b5c7a3f5a9f1b5caac4379daddfefa39c5074e54703b1d1ce35abf7",
      "tipo_discord": 0,
      "referencia": null,
      "url_discord": "https://discord.com/channels/946724148628041748/1465410265544921190/1484248397937512651",
      "texto_sha256": "0edfb78775ae50d9256cfc69b97a6aea4c400b3a517548f5919534cc87fbf2ed",
      "adjuntos": []
    },
    {
      "id": "1484249482655961088",
      "fecha_utc": "2026-03-19T17:57:32.687000+00:00",
      "fecha_local": "2026-03-19",
      "editado_utc": null,
      "texto": "Kilzer: cuando este mas libre te debo una cena si",
      "mensaje_sha256": "622d1b4cd4ab3f9194b8d82cd6180c4e7781c60e0d1ebd6f529197f57c00b2a5",
      "tipo_discord": 0,
      "referencia": null,
      "url_discord": "https://discord.com/channels/946724148628041748/1465410265544921190/1484249482655961088",
      "texto_sha256": "501ce22016ac306c0f0d9737de9ef5872e1cda66dbca25105c3a55a7961536d2",
      "adjuntos": []
    },
    {
      "id": "1484252425131917312",
      "fecha_utc": "2026-03-19T18:09:14.228000+00:00",
      "fecha_local": "2026-03-19",
      "editado_utc": null,
      "texto": "Ione: mas te vale... Que estos tablones son los de repuesto de mi barco...**Se sienta en una de las sillas** Voy a tener que cortar mas arboles y hacer mas... **Se sacude un poco y la sale serrin**",
      "mensaje_sha256": "9dac58291e231c0f8671b389932b74378cee60218675149275253a8c7e588f44",
      "tipo_discord": 19,
      "referencia": "1484249482655961088",
      "url_discord": "https://discord.com/channels/946724148628041748/1465410265544921190/1484252425131917312",
      "texto_sha256": "66bddd2336cee7d00fd19e59dcc3f7e23593ca96b744b981b98ec8f5e1f067cf",
      "adjuntos": []
    },
    {
      "id": "1484253096153452725",
      "fecha_utc": "2026-03-19T18:11:54.212000+00:00",
      "fecha_local": "2026-03-19",
      "editado_utc": null,
      "texto": "Kilzer: si puedo te ayudo otro dia",
      "mensaje_sha256": "cc901039fbdceee733eb34ef0c3578dcf76a71babc2520c1d679506db1f14ba5",
      "tipo_discord": 0,
      "referencia": null,
      "url_discord": "https://discord.com/channels/946724148628041748/1465410265544921190/1484253096153452725",
      "texto_sha256": "e20012e5f3e68abcacf0d5306b7e2068a7ceeab1d18a01e536eba6460c13be6a",
      "adjuntos": []
    },
    {
      "id": "1484253747575132181",
      "fecha_utc": "2026-03-19T18:14:29.523000+00:00",
      "fecha_local": "2026-03-19",
      "editado_utc": null,
      "texto": "Ione: **Le mira y sonrie divertida** ¿Acaso sabes hacer algo asi?",
      "mensaje_sha256": "141efb434eb168ff30c70a21ecdd49d131967344a8d5ba8d655ca1ddf66f656c",
      "tipo_discord": 19,
      "referencia": "1484253096153452725",
      "url_discord": "https://discord.com/channels/946724148628041748/1465410265544921190/1484253747575132181",
      "texto_sha256": "0dedc5870e8b7f9a58672706e97d5953b442ef7d84be0f2eea1e815e553db5d1",
      "adjuntos": []
    },
    {
      "id": "1484254044691239052",
      "fecha_utc": "2026-03-19T18:15:40.361000+00:00",
      "fecha_local": "2026-03-19",
      "editado_utc": null,
      "texto": "Kilzer: no pero se me da bien apoyar",
      "mensaje_sha256": "dc2d2c2919d312057ad1188673cf9378a9faefe60e1a49272e303a852914e0d1",
      "tipo_discord": 0,
      "referencia": null,
      "url_discord": "https://discord.com/channels/946724148628041748/1465410265544921190/1484254044691239052",
      "texto_sha256": "d4c475847fda3bc558c61969639675db45553697ba4012bc63c8f36317da3296",
      "adjuntos": []
    },
    {
      "id": "1484256280121180290",
      "fecha_utc": "2026-03-19T18:24:33.329000+00:00",
      "fecha_local": "2026-03-19",
      "editado_utc": null,
      "texto": "Ione: ¿Me apoyarias con el vino que tienes guardado ahi? **Se toca la nariz de modo que lo ha olido...**",
      "mensaje_sha256": "fcd578bce46a7267efbaa76ea378ec80cba19405fb4b6d613088ca97da4c296c",
      "tipo_discord": 19,
      "referencia": "1484254044691239052",
      "url_discord": "https://discord.com/channels/946724148628041748/1465410265544921190/1484256280121180290",
      "texto_sha256": "4cba8e7b9b3d950bd72c4744f970bcc0ffe21b4827fe781a0c21f1df3160c4d7",
      "adjuntos": []
    },
    {
      "id": "1484263218309365880",
      "fecha_utc": "2026-03-19T18:52:07.522000+00:00",
      "fecha_local": "2026-03-19",
      "editado_utc": null,
      "texto": "Kilzer: si esta bien",
      "mensaje_sha256": "fed4c5acf1e7023693c93d7d6050412a5589e13b84e1f120938e5df28cba26e8",
      "tipo_discord": 0,
      "referencia": null,
      "url_discord": "https://discord.com/channels/946724148628041748/1465410265544921190/1484263218309365880",
      "texto_sha256": "9ee8f649e35856f1628a384200dc429424354d43749d104c071de1ade20b133d",
      "adjuntos": []
    },
    {
      "id": "1484264262007525427",
      "fecha_utc": "2026-03-19T18:56:16.359000+00:00",
      "fecha_local": "2026-03-19",
      "editado_utc": null,
      "texto": "Ione: **Sonrie con una sonrisa deslumbrante** Sirva (Pausamos aqui)",
      "mensaje_sha256": "5adfc3ea354b175ad6c52de4ccf4e1d2b1e8a21083b6f82db9d602dcfc12d1e9",
